    <h1>The Diagnostician: <em>Investigator</em> Strengths and Careers</h1>
    <p class="dek">If you cannot let a problem go until you understand why it really happened, Investigator is likely one of your top strengths. Here is what it is, the careers that reward it, how it holds up against AI, and the blind spot that keeps strong diagnosticians digging too long.</p>
